          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Isaka avukũa ĩngĩ ithima sya manzĩ, ila menzĩte matukũ ma Avalaamu ĩthe wake; nũndũ Avilisiti nĩmailindile Avalaamu akw’a: na asyĩta masyĩtwa masyo kũatĩĩa masyĩtwa ala syeetawa nĩ ĩthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
