          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa mũthenya o ũsu athũkũmi ma Isaka mooka, na mamũtavya ũvoo wa kĩthima kĩla menzie, mamwĩa, Nĩtwonie manzĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na akĩta Siva: kwondũ wa ũu syĩtwa ya ndũa ĩsu nĩ Mbeeli‐sieva kũvika mũnthĩ ũũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
